      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Vibrant and healthy captive axolotls"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers praise the variety of healthy, active axolotls in diverse color morphs available at the store and through nationwide shipping. Reviewers emphasize that newly adopted aquatic pets settle well, feed readily, and arrive securely packaged. While two critical reviews express moral concerns regarding captive breeding facilities and bare tank environments, the majority of pet keepers describe thriving animals."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Knowledgeable and enthusiastic aquatic team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors highlight the warm welcome and helpful guidance provided by staff members Drew, Michael, and the owner's family. Clients appreciate the detailed advice offered on aquarium cycling, water temperature management, and proper feeding routines. Although an isolated complaint described an unfriendly reception, most visitors commend the team's enthusiasm and dedication to educating keepers."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Safe shipping and quality supplies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Online purchasers report dependable delivery and secure, climate-conscious packaging when ordering axolotls and supplies from the Dallas storefront. Reviewers note that shipments arrive alive and well even during periods of inclement weather, commending the high quality of food pellets, chilling equipment, and water treatments."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Axolotl Planet ship axolotls nationwide?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the company provides climate-controlled delivery for live axolotls and aquatics equipment across the United States."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "When is the Dallas showroom open to the public?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The storefront opens Friday through Sunday from 11:00 to 19:00 (12:00 to 18:00 on Sunday), and is closed Monday to Thursday."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do staff provide advice on water care and tank cycling?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently report receiving detailed instructions on maintaining proper tank parameters and water temperature."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What aquatics supplies are stocked in the shop?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The store stocks specialized axolotl diets, cooling systems, filtration gear, and tank water treatments."
      },
